{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19213","headline":"寄杨八拾遗 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄杨八拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君前日独庭争，汉帝偏知白马生。\n忽领簿书游太学，宁劳侍从厌承明。\n洛阳本自宜才子，海内而今有直声。\n爲谢同僚老博士，范云来岁即公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}